# =============================================================================
# Run output (regeneratable; not version-controlled)
# =============================================================================

# [Step 13 of unified-codebase rebuild: adapter outputs at runs/<SSP>/inputs/
#  are derived from intermediary_py CSV outputs via tools/imogen_inputs_to_lpjg_format.py.
#  Regenerable; not committed. The output tree is at runs/<SSP>/output/. - DKB 2026-05-07]

# Per-scenario run outputs
runs/*/output/
runs/*/scratch/
runs/*/saved_state*/
runs/*/inputs/
# [Step 14: runtime artifacts produced by scripts/run_coupled.sh in each
#  scenario's Common-directory/. Engine per-year output, LPJG handshake
#  files, etc. All regenerable. - DKB 2026-05-07]
runs/*/Common-directory/

# [Step 16: workstation parallel mimic test (scripts/run_parallel_mimic.sh)
#  produces per-rank work dirs at runs/<SSP>/parallel_work/. All regenerable
#  by re-running the mimic test. - DKB 2026-05-08]
runs/*/parallel_work/

# [Step 17c.0.7: workstation mpirun -np 4 mimic xval harness
#  (scripts/cross_validate_mpi_4rank.sh) produces per-mode <mode>_<size>_runs/
#  subdirs at runs/<SSP>/parallel_work_xval_mpi/. All regenerable by re-running
#  the harness. Distinct from runs/<SSP>/parallel_work/ (Step 16) so the two
#  artifact families don't collide. - DKB 2026-05-15]
runs/*/parallel_work_xval_mpi/

# [Step 16: cluster MPI build at lpjguess/build_mpi/ produced by
#  scripts/cluster/make_guess.sh --mpi. Regenerable from source. - DKB 2026-05-08]
lpjguess/build_mpi/

# IMOGEN run output (per-year directories with climate files)
**/Common-directory/IMOGEN/output/
**/IMOGEN/output/

# [Block 8.2.5 (2026-05-26) NEW: gitignore patterns for the switchable-regrid-strategy
#  per-pipeline output libraries + per-SSP runtime dirs that emerged in this block.
#  Per `notes/CLUSTER_SETUP_AND_PRODUCTION_RUNS.md` §1 POST-BLOCK-8.2.5 + the wiring
#  plan at `_chat_artifacts/b8_2_5_switchable_regrid_2026-05-26/B8_2_5_wiring_plan.md`:
#  - **/Common-directory-fortranengine/  : new per-SSP runtime dir for δ-B Fortran-engine
#    pipeline (sibling to existing Common-directory/ which has C++ engine output);
#    contains imogen_settings.txt (THIS file is committed; see negation below) +
#    LPJG_main/IMOGEN/ handshake state (not committed) + IMOGEN/output/ year-dirs
#    (3698-grid Fortran engine output) + IMOGEN/output_62892/ year-dirs
#    (post-FastRegrid IDW 62892-grid output for paper Track 2 cluster production)
#  - **/IMOGEN/output_*/  : ALL post-FastRegrid variants (output_62892/ from δ-B IDW;
#    output_3698_cppengine/ from δ-B-variant chained-NN intermediate; output_62892_cppengine/
#    from δ-B-variant final IDW; output_62892_fortranengine/ = same as output_62892/ for δ-B)
#  - logs/run_fortran_engine_only_*.log + logs/run_fastregrid_*.log : per-run engine
#    + regrid driver logs at MB to tens-of-MB sizes (verbose engine outputs across 201 years);
#    too big for git ergonomics + regenerable from source. - DKB block 8.2.5]
# NOTE: don't use `**/Common-directory-fortranengine/` (too aggressive — excludes
# the parent dir + git negation can't re-include files once parent is excluded).
# Instead explicitly exclude only the data subdirs (IMOGEN/, LPJG_main/) — keeps
# imogen_settings.txt at the dir root tracked.
**/Common-directory-fortranengine/IMOGEN/
**/Common-directory-fortranengine/LPJG_main/
**/IMOGEN/output_*/
logs/run_fortran_engine_only_*.log
logs/run_fastregrid_*.log

# [Block 8.2.5 (2026-05-26): forensic backups created during the IYEAR-1→IYEAR
#  + NGPOINTS=3698→3696 + STANDALONE fixes; preserved on filesystem per Rule #10
#  amendment-vs-rewrite but NOT committed (regenerable + bulky). - DKB block 8.2.5]
forks/trunk_r13078_runs/*/imogen_intermediary.ins.pre_block_8_2_4_predecessor_baseline

# [Block 8.2.5 (2026-05-26): trim the 36+ MB phase_d_ssp126_canary_v5.log + similar
