intermediary_py/imogen_ghg_controller/outputs_baseline_may7/
runs/*/inputs_baseline_may7/

# [Block 8.0.3 (session 8.0.3 close, 2026-05-20): T_seq Installment-1 acceptance test
#  surfaced need for forks/trunk_r13078_runs/<SSP>/ operational scratch gitignore
#  parallel to runs/<SSP>/ gitignore patterns above. Per `forks/trunk_r13078_runs/README.md`
#  T_seq workflow (Step C trunk-T_seq LPJG against pre-baked engine library), the SSP
#  dirs accumulate: (a) LPJG output files (*.out, ~56 files per run; all regenerable);
#  (b) Common-directory symlink (operational; user sets up per pre-run setup);
#  (c) state/saved_state/ subdirs (when save_state 1); (d) *.pid + *.log run-tracking
#  files (covered by *.log + *.pid global patterns above but also explicit here).
#  All regenerable; not committed. - DKB 2026-05-20 block 8.0.3]
forks/trunk_r13078_runs/*/Common-directory/
forks/trunk_r13078_runs/*/Common-directory
forks/trunk_r13078_runs/*/*.out
forks/trunk_r13078_runs/*/state/
forks/trunk_r13078_runs/*/saved_state*/
forks/trunk_r13078_runs/*/output/
